    Bug 1926711 - Account Hub Font Awareness, set max-height for content and make forms scrollable. r=aleca

    **How to Test**
    - View the config found, manual config, and sync accounts steps in account hub
    - Open developer console and set a custom font-size for the base html element
    - Test font sizes 12px to 22px

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D237115

